# openOODA public site

File: openOODA.github.io/README.oot
Public site for https://openooda.org. This tree is the door, the guide, and the pin endpoint. Not the compiler. Not the wiki (`openOODA/wiki`).

The public system is three places: door, guide, store.

Door: https://openooda.org/
Guide: https://openooda.org/guide/
Store: https://registry.openooda.org

The store host is `registry.openooda.org`. Do not rename that host.

## What is on disk

| Path | What it actually is |
| :--- | :--- |
| `index.html` | Product door. Pin next to the wordmark. |
| `guide/` | User wiki. Home, start, language, commands, packages, capabilities, how it works. |
| `install` | `.oo` payload for the public pin command `curl -fsSL https://openooda.org/install | oo`. Not a shell script. |

`research/` is an archive of design drafts. Not nav. Not product. Old URLs stay so they do not 404. `research.html` redirects to `/research/`.

There is no playground. There are no API docs on this site. Product truth lives on the private boards: `openOODA/SHIPPED.oot`.

The door, guide, and 404 have a one-line address field. It POSTs to `https://collect.openooda.org/v1/emails`. That stores the address. It is not a newsletter.

## Install

```
curl -fsSL https://openooda.org/install | oo
```

`https://openooda.org/install` is `.oo`. Never `| sh`.

## Local preview

Use any static file server. Do not add `.py` helpers.

## Residual

Native compiler, product std, and live proofs are not in this repo.
